flowchart TD
  accTitle: Runtime plugin hook order
  accDescr: Require checks cache before initializer lookup. Bail hooks are synchronous in require. Dynamic imports load resources before requiring the module.
  Boot["Bootstrap module system"] --> bootstrap
  Require["require(moduleId)"] --> Cache{"Module cached?"}
  Cache -->|yes| readModuleCache --> Skip{"Truthy result: skip cache?"}
  Skip -->|no| Return["Return cached exports"]
  Skip -->|yes| Exists{"Initializer registered?"}
  Cache -->|no| Exists
  Exists -->|yes| moduleCreated --> Init["Execute module factory"] --> moduleInitialized --> Ready["Return exports"]
  Exists -->|no| External["Configured external lookup"] --> moduleNotFound --> Fallback["Handled result / Node require / empty object"]
  Dynamic["dynamic import(moduleId)"] --> loadResource --> Require
  bootstrap -. "later calls" .-> Require
